---
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo/wdth.css'; import '@fontsource/dm-mono/400.css'; import SecondaryMasthead from '../../components/SecondaryMasthead.astro'; import { cvEntries } from '../../data/portfolio-entries';
import { siteUrl } from '../../data/seo';
const boundary='Client work stays private. The public repositories are independent labs and sanitized extracts. They are not client deployments, production tenure, or a Nous affiliation.';
const title = 'Experience | Dave Bettner';
const description =
  'Ten years of customer-facing implementation across reporting, assurance, and healthcare integrations, plus the newer public agent engineering work that extends it.';
const canonical = `${siteUrl}/experience/`;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <meta name="description" content={description}/>
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090b"/>
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"/>
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/interstellar-system.css"/>
  <meta property="og:type" content="profile"/>
  <meta property="og:title" content={title}/>
  <meta property="og:description" content={description}/>
  <meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/>
  <meta property="og:image" content={`${siteUrl}/images/dave-bettner-og.jpg`}/>
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/>
  <meta name="twitter:title" content={title}/>
  <meta name="twitter:description" content={description}/>
  <title>{title}</title>
</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><SecondaryMasthead context="Experience · dated record"/><main id="main"><section class="route-intro"><div class="wrap content-page"><h1>I’ve spent ten years getting enterprise implementations to go-live.</h1><p class="lead">Most of my work has been in reporting and assurance. I have also led healthcare integrations, customer demos, solution design, and the handoff from sales to delivery. The public agent projects are a newer part of the story.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap content-page"><div class="career-rail" aria-label="Career chronology"><span><b>2015–21</b> Workiva</span><span><b>2021–22</b> Ambra Health</span><span><b>2022–24</b> Workiva</span><span><b>2024–25</b> Citrin Cooperman</span><span><b>2025–now</b> LSL</span></div><ol class="timeline">{cvEntries.map(entry=><li><span class="timeline-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="mono dates">{entry.dates}</p><h2>{entry.title}</h2><p>{entry.line}</p>{entry.bullets?.length?<ul>{entry.bullets.map(b=><li>{b}</li>)}</ul>:null}</li>)}</ol><section class="engineering-bridge"><h2>The agent work is newer.</h2><p>I started publishing independent agent labs and tools in 2026. They cover orchestration, guarded integrations, failure recovery, and evaluation. They are not customer deployments, but they show how I build.</p><p class="page-links"><a href="/work/">View public work →</a><a href="/fit/">View field approach →</a></p></section><p class="evidence-boundary">{boundary}</p><nav class="page-links"><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/work/">Work</a><a href="/fit/">Field approach</a><a href="/#contact">Contact</a></nav></div></section></main><script is:inline type="module" src="/interstellar.js"></script></body></html>
<style is:global>
.content-page{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,88px) 0}.route-intro{background:#121315!important}.route-intro h1{max-width:18ch;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.8vw,4.8rem)}.lead{max-width:70ch;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px;line-height:1.65}.career-rail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));margin-bottom:56px;border-block:1px solid var(--rule)}.career-rail span{padding:14px 14px 14px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}.career-rail b{display:block;color:var(--orange);font:500 .72rem 'DM Mono',monospace;margin-bottom:4px}.timeline{list-style:none;border-left:1px solid var(--rule);padding-left:28px}.timeline li{position:relative;padding:0 0 38px}.timeline-mark{position:absolute;left:-34px;top:5px;width:10px;height:10px;background:var(--orange);border:1px solid var(--orange)}.dates{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}.timeline h2{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:8px}.location{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.timeline ul{margin:10px 0 0 20px}.engineering-bridge{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:24px;padding-top:36px;max-width:70ch}.engineering-bridge h2{margin-bottom:14px}.engineering-bridge>p:not(.mono):not(.page-links){color:var(--muted)}.page-links{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.page-links a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.evidence-boundary{margin-top:48px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);max-width:80ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}@media(max-width:720px){.career-rail{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));margin-bottom:40px}.career-rail span{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.timeline>li>p,.timeline ul{line-height:1.65}.wrap{width:calc(100% - 28px)}}
</style>